---
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<section id="about" class="reveal">
    <div class="wrap about-grid">
        <div>
            <p class="eyebrow-num">02 / about</p>
            <h2>About</h2>
            <p>
                I'm <strong>{site.name}</strong>, a full-stack developer in Durban, South Africa. I finished a Diploma in Systems Development (HDIPSD2) at Boston City Campus with a 76% average, a pass with distinction, and I hold CompTIA A+ and Security+.
            </p>
            <p>
                I work in <strong>Java, PHP, JavaScript and TypeScript</strong>, with React, Astro, Node.js, Docker and MySQL. At Future ProTechY I build backend services for financial systems and work with <strong>AWS</strong> day to day: VPCs, EC2 and GitHub Actions pipelines. I am still learning the cloud side, and I say so.
            </p>
            <p>
                Before writing code I want to understand the business. I have done requirements gathering and analysis on client work, and I delivered the Asante Financial Services loan platform on my own, from the first conversation to the production server.
            </p>
        </div>
        <ul class="facts">
            <li><span class="k">based</span><span class="v">{site.city}</span></li>
            <li><span class="k">status</span><span class="v status-ok">{site.availability}</span></li>
            <li><span class="k">focus</span><span class="v">{site.focusLabel}</span></li>
            <li><span class="k">currently</span><span class="v">{site.currently}</span></li>
            <li><span class="k">cloud</span><span class="v">AWS (VPC, EC2, CI/CD) at work, still learning</span></li>
            <li><span class="k">education</span><span class="v">Diploma HDIPSD2 (76% Distinction)</span></li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</section>
